; Columns three and four re-run the second through an intervening Node3D and Label3D. Label3D
; derives from GeometryInstance3D (`label_3d.h:38`) as SpriteBase3D does (`sprite_3d.h:36`), a
; sibling, not an ancestor, so it breaks the chain despite its own `modulate`.
